Keep the Cargo workspace limited to the three utilities shipped in easybox.
This lets the RPM build resolve dependencies for the installed commands
using the openRuyi system crate registry. Use the distribution phf
0.11 series and allow compatible textwrap updates. Remove the unused
uucore features that require additional, unused registry crates.

Upstream: https://gitcode.com/openeuler/easybox
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [openRuyi package feature selection]

